  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong, cohesive dark editorial treatment with a commanding headline, disciplined cyan/red/amber accents, clear card grouping, and responsive restructuring across all three viewports. It falls short of demo-ready polish: much supporting copy and mono metadata is undersized and low-contrast; desktop has excessive empty space and an imbalanced hero annotation; tablet/mobile cards become text-dense; and the tablet/mobile header visibly clips navigation, with the mobile header dropping the product name and red-mode action. Contrast evidence for header links is also incomplete.",
